IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oilpol-liability`

-- Merchant Shipping (Civil Liability and Compensation for Oil Pollution) Act 1998, ss 3 to 6, 12, 13, 15, 20, 25, 27, 28 and 30 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_merchant-shipping-civil-liability-and-compensation-for-oil-pollution-act-1998.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

